  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>搬运工</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>本模组可让你轻松搬运箱子、实体和刷怪笼，但会获得缓慢效果并加速饥饿值消耗。</p><p>使用Shift+右键点击拾取物品。</p><p>可在Minecraft控制设置中修改快捷键。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">本模组需要</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><a style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a>支持</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">加入我们的Discord！</span></strong></span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fG4PjhEf\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://discordapp.com/api/guilds/707435077679841350/embed.png?style=banner2&amp;v=2\" width=\"337\" height=\"80\"></em></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">在Patreon上支持我！</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/notsteven\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5Wog2kV.png\" width=\"339\" height=\"69\"></span></a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>需要服务器？</strong></span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fnotsteven\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/e4c02994-c687-4670-84d8-2bbbf94721e9.webp\" alt=\"bisect\" width=\"900\" height=\"142\"></a></p>",
